# Rubik's Cube solver for LEGO MINDSTORMS EV3 + Pybricks
#
# Self-contained Kociemba two-phase solver. The coordinate/search structure
# is derived from the GPLv2 kociemba Python implementation by Herbert
# Kociemba and contributors; compact precomputed tables are embedded so the
# EV3 needs no external files or Python packages.
# Source reference: https://github.com/muodov/kociemba

